ommentary) – the cups remain on the table, occasionally moving slightly as judges gesticulate, but the “SONIC” branding never changes.  \n- **Later frames** (after the performances) – another close‑up repeats the same cup, confirming that the prop is a permanent part of the set rather than a one‑off prop.\n\nThus, the scene shows the judges continuously surrounded by identical blue cups with red straws, each clearly printed with the word **“SONIC.”** This visual evidence satisfies all verification criteria (cup visibility, printed and readable text, placement on the judges’ table, consistent design, and presence of the Sonic logo) across multiple timestamps.', 'failed_images': []}
